              <h3>Vans Inventory Rebalance</h3>
              <p>Leading the Inventory Rebalance initiative for the Vans AMER region: optimizing how inventory is allocated across the distribution network so that stock sits where demand actually is, rather than piling up in some locations while others run short. Built on Python, Databricks, and machine learning.</p>
