              <p>Designed, built, and deployed a Hybrid Matrix Factorization recommendation model for Kohls.com product detail pages using LightFM, BigQuery, Vertex AI, and Kubeflow. Led the architecture and code reviews and drove the cross-functional rollout with engineering and product.</p>
